@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Weather Station System

[*] --> Running

state "Running" as Running
state "Configuration" as Configuration
state "Controlled" as Controlled
state "Shutdown" as Shutdown

Running : entry / Collect data, prepare summary, check status
Running : do / Perform activities
Running : exit / Return to running state

Running --> Configuration : [Changes or power-saving settings required]
Configuration --> Running : [Configuration completed]

Running --> Controlled : [Remote control command received]
Controlled --> Shutdown : [Shutdown command given while running]

Running --> Running : [Clock trigger]

Running --> RequestSummary : [Weather summary requested]
RequestSummary --> PrepareSummary : [Prepare and send out a weather summary]
PrepareSummary --> Running : [Weather summary prepared]

Running --> RequestStatus : [Status checking requested]
RequestStatus --> CheckStatus : [Check its own status and transmit the result]
CheckStatus --> Running : [Status checked]

Shutdown : entry / Shut down condition
Shutdown : do / System is shut down
Shutdown : exit / End

@enduml
